      "updated": 1791021281440,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Corrective-RAG (CRAG) is a methodology in the RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) \nstrategy that adds a step to evaluate the retrieved documents. \n\nThis approach involves reviewing the search results before generation.",
