      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Corrective-RAG (CRAG) is a methodology in the RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) \nstrategy that adds a step to evaluate the retrieved documents. \n\nThis approach involves reviewing the search results before generation.",
